atorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\cdot \\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}\\cancel{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{1} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\frac{{sin}^{3}⁡x{cos}^{2}⁡x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x{cos}^{4}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\n$$" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255668 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255669 13194139533855 true] [17592186255668 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255670 13194139533855 true] [17592186255668 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255671 13194139533855 true] [17592186255668 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255672 13194139533855 true] [17592186255668 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255673 13194139533855 true] [17592186255668 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533855 true] [17592186255668 1041 "selection" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255668 1104 #edb/ref 17592186255673 13194139533855 true] [17592186255668 1110 #uuid "77361238-17d3-5cd7-8510-3767db94a1b5" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255669 1034 "\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-1" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255669 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533855 true] [17592186255669 1111 #uuid "778237c3-895e-55bb-b150-48f1c8f5d6cd" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255670 1034 "2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255670 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533855 true] [17592186255670 1111 #uuid "e518a321-2f53-5c86-bd6b-5d3ca27b3199" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255671 1034 "\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+1" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255671 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533855 true] [17592186255671 1111 #uuid "ac72b2cf-d7be-5f2c-8fb0-3e63de067e6b" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255672 1034 "1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255672 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533855 true] [17592186255672 1111 #uuid "017a304a-5599-5c27-85d2