frac{({sin}^{2}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x)-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{tan}⁡x-\\frac{1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}=\\frac{1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}\n$$" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255675 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255676 13194139533855 true] [17592186255675 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255677 13194139533855 true] [17592186255675 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255678 13194139533855 true] [17592186255675 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255679 13194139533855 true] [17592186255675 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255680 13194139533855 true] [17592186255675 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533855 true] [17592186255675 1041 "selection" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255675 1104 #edb/ref 17592186255676 13194139533855 true] [17592186255675 1110 #uuid "f5bcad66-2a74-5df9-9f28-2f374449287b" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255676 1034 "\\frac{1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255676 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533855 true] [17592186255676 1111 #uuid "5e2e0c4f-3f6f-598d-ad82-a2d0810ce0a2" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255677 1034 "\\frac{1+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255677 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533855 true] [17592186255677 1111 #uuid "80fab331-80c5-5498-b2c2-f14d08a434c2" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255678 1034 "\\frac{1-{cos}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255678 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533855 true] [17592186255678 1111 #uuid "6c5d4bb1-8b42-5105-9758-25703be29a9c" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255679 1034 "\\frac{1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255679 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533855 true] [175