7592186255772 1145 "First, we factor $\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ from the first two terms:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{sin}^{3}⁡x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x{cos}^{2}⁡x+1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x({sin}^{2}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x)+1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}\n$$\n\nNext, we use the Pythagorean identity to rewrite the expression in the parentheses, and then we simplify the resulting expression as much as possible:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x({sin}^{2}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x)+1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x} & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}+\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we conclude that:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{sin}^{3}⁡x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x{cos}^{2}⁡x+1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}=\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\n$$" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255773 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255774 13194139533855 true] [17592186255773 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255775 13194139533855 true] [17592186255773 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255776 13194139533855 true] [17592186255773 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255777 13194139533855 true] [17592186255773 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255778 13194139533855 true] [17592186255773 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533855 true] [17592186255773 1041 "selection" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255773 1104 #edb/ref 17592186255778 13194139533855 true] [17592186255773 1110 #uuid "ebca33b5-a1ca-561d-a53a-a7f4a65957ca" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255774 1034 "2\\operatorname{tan}⁡x" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255774 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533855 true] [17592186255774 1111 #uuid "652a519e-6044-55c9-b687-0eaf451aa4e8" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255775 1034 "\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+1" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255775 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533855 true] [17592186255775 1111 #uuid "fe24a001-2ae3-5a28-96d0-c946472cf018" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255776 1034 "2\\operatornam