 \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x+{sin}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we simplify as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x+{sin}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x} & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+({cos}^{2}⁡x+{sin}^{2}⁡x)}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}+\\operatorname{tan}⁡x=\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}\n$$" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255780 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255781 13194139533855 true] [17592186255780 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255782 13194139533855 true] [17592186255780 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255783 13194139533855 true] [17592186255780 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255784 13194139533855 true] [17592186255780 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255785 13194139533855 true] [17592186255780 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533855 true] [17592186255780 1041 "selection" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255780 1104 #edb/ref 17592186255782 13194139533855 true] [17592186255780 1110 #uuid "a500c715-0776-5236-aa09-d237e03c000f" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255781 1034 "\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255781 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533855 true] [17592186255781 1111 #uuid "c2724473-e724-50db-a638-d8de10a1e471" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255782 1034 "\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255782 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533855 true] [17592186255782 1111 #uuid "f8eb1ad0-d6f6-5e7c-ae54-8a2f5e985ae0" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255783 1034 "\\frac{2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}" 13194139533855 true] [17592186255783 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13